              descID: 'Hadar membuka MFG_01_Production_Metrics.xlsx di Excel desktop dan meminta Copilot menyegarkan tab Line OEE Dashboard, Quality Reject Log, Production Plan vs Actual, Raw Material Cost Tracker and Customer Order Fulfillment tabs.'
