      taglineIDEN: 'Attrition 38%, 4 of the top 6 anchor clients amber, IDR 980 billion in renewals — Executive Committee in 5 days.',
      scenarioIDEN: 'Zava BPO Indonesia operates 9 multilingual delivery centres in the regional capital, Bandung, Cebu, and the regional capital with 11,200 seats serving banking, insurance, and consumer clients. Annualised attrition has climbed to 38%, the SLA Dashboard shows 4 of the top 6 anchor clients in amber, and 2 contracts worth IDR 980 billion are scheduled for renewal in 12 weeks. The Labour Ministry has asked for a written response on overtime practices, the National Cyber Agency has flagged a near-miss data incident at the Bandung site, and the Personal Data Protection audit cycle starts next month. The CEO needs an integrated recovery and renewal pack for the Executive Committee in 5 days.',
