      geo: 'MY',
      companyBM: 'Zava Glove Berhad',
      taglineBM: 'US FDA Form 483 + perintah tahan-lepas CBP AS berkaitan buruh paksa — pertanyaan ASEAN Stock Exchange dalam 7 hari.',
      scenarioBM: 'Zava Glove Berhad ialah pengeluar sarung tangan getah tersenarai di ASEAN Stock Exchange dengan 8 kilang merentas Centralia, Negeri Sembilan dan Kedah, menghasilkan 92 bilion sarung tangan setahun untuk pasaran perubatan, pemeriksaan dan industri di 195 negara. US FDA mengeluarkan Form 483 dengan 9 pemerhatian terhadap kilang Centralia yang meliputi dokumentasi, pemantauan alam sekitar dan kawalan bioburden. US Customs and Border Protection telah mengeluarkan Withhold Release Order terhadap satu barisan pengeluaran, memetik indikator buruh paksa dalam rantaian pengambilan pekerja migran. Penarafan ESG turun 2 takuk dan harga saham jatuh 14% dalam 5 sesi. ASEAN Stock Exchange telah mengeluarkan pertanyaan aktiviti pasaran luar biasa dan Suruhanjaya Sekuriti Malaysia meminta pendedahan tambahan dalam 7 hari. Group CFO perlu menyelaras pemulihan FDA, pemulihan pekerja migran sejajar ILO, pembaikan ESG, komunikasi kovenan pemberi pinjaman, dan taklimat Jawatankuasa Audit secara serentak. Rangka rujukan pelanggan sebenar: kumpulan ini beroperasi seperti rakan setara sarung tangan getah serantau.',
      companyIDEN: 'Zava Glove Berhad',
      taglineIDEN: 'FDA Form 483 + CBP forced-labour WRO — ASEAN Stock Exchange query in 7 days.',
      scenarioIDEN: 'Zava Glove Berhad is a rubber-glove producer listed on ASEAN Stock Exchange with 8 factories in Centralia, Negeri Sembilan, and Kedah, producing 92 billion gloves per year for medical, exam, and industrial markets in 195 countries. The US FDA issued a Form 483 with 9 observations at the Centralia plant covering documentation, environmental monitoring, and bioburden controls. US CBP issued a Withhold Release Order on one production line, citing forced-labour indicators in the migrant-worker recruitment chain. ESG ratings fell 2 notches and the share price dropped 14% in 5 sessions. ASEAN Stock Exchange issued an unusual market activity query and the Malaysia Securities Commission requested supplementary disclosure within 7 days. The Group Finance Director must coordinate FDA remediation, ILO-aligned migrant-worker remediation, ESG repair, lender covenant communication, and an Audit Committee briefing all at once. Real customer reference frame: the group operates like regional rubber-glove manufacturing peers.',
