      taglineBM: 'Pembaharuan kelulusan alam sekitar JAEC + sekatan eksport REE China — kemas kini ASEAN Stock Exchange dalam 14 hari.',
      scenarioBM: 'Zava Rare Earth mengendalikan loji konsentrat nadir bumi berat bersepadu di Pahang dan kemudahan pemisahan hiliran di Gebeng yang menghasilkan oksida neodymium, dysprosium dan terbium untuk pelanggan magnet EV dan turbin angin global. Pembaharuan kelulusan alam sekitar Atomic Energy Licensing Board (AELB) akan tamat tempoh dalam 90 hari; pemegang taruh masyarakat sivil telah membangkitkan kebimbangan sisa TENORM. MOFCOM China turut mengetatkan pelesenan eksport REE, mendorong harga global naik 28% dalam 4 minggu. ASEAN Stock Exchange menjangka kemas kini operasi dalam 14 hari. Ketua Pegawai Kewangan Kumpulan memerlukan naratif teknikal JAEC/AELB, rancangan libat urus masyarakat sivil, analisis pass-through harga pelanggan dan pendedahan ASEAN Stock Exchange yang diselaraskan. Rangka rujukan: pengendali nadir bumi dan perlombongan serantau yang sebanding.',
      companyIDEN: 'Zava Rare Earth',
      taglineIDEN: 'JAEC environmental approval renewal + China REE export curb — ASEAN Stock Exchange update in 14 days.',
      scenarioIDEN: 'Zava Rare Earth operates an integrated heavy rare-earth concentrate plant in Pahang and a downstream separation facility in Gebeng producing neodymium, dysprosium, and terbium oxides for global EV magnet and wind-turbine customers. The Atomic Energy Licensing Board (AELB) environmental-approval renewal is due in 90 days; civil-society stakeholders have raised TENORM-residue concerns. China MOFCOM tightened REE export licensing in parallel, lifting global pricing 28% in 4 weeks. ASEAN Stock Exchange expects an operational update in 14 days. The Group CFO needs the JAEC/AELB technical narrative, civil-society engagement plan, customer pricing pass-through analysis, and ASEAN Stock Exchange disclosure all coordinated. Reference frame: comparable regional rare-earth and mining operators.',
