        'Tan Chong Motor Holdings',
        'Hasjrat Abadi (Toyota dealer ID)',
        'Mitra Pinasthika Mustika (MPM Honda dealer)',
        'Daya Adira Mustika (Triputra)',
        'DRB-Hicom Auto'
