      scenarioIDEN: 'The October close was 3 days late due to intercompany reconciliation failures across 12 entities. Operating expenses missed RKAP by -22%%. Trade payables ageing >90 days reached IDR 280 billion, triggering supplier payment holds and threatening production continuity. Two loan covenants risk breach (Debt/EBITDA nearing the 3.5x limit). The FY2026 RKAP submission deadline is in 45 days, but the finance team cannot plan ahead while firefighting. The Audit Committee has requested a 15%% cost reset proposal with an implementation roadmap within 30 days.',
