              prompt: 'Open /RSK_05_Incident_Log.xlsx in Excel for Web. Using Copilot in Excel, combine data from THREE tabs — Incident Log, Impact Assessment AND Notification Status — and create a new sheet called "Incident Escalation Dashboard". Build a waterfall chart for each of the 3 unnotified Q3 incidents showing the movement from Discovery to Assessment to Escalation to Board Notification with days elapsed at each stage. Beside each waterfall, add an impact tile pulling from the Impact Assessment tab (financial exposure in MYR M) and a notification-status indicator pulling from the Notification Status tab. Sort the incidents from highest impact to lowest, highlight unnotified incidents in red banding, and embed a one-sentence status note beside each Red incident. Output a Board-pack-ready escalation dashboard sheet.'
