            instructions: 'Trigger: "3 flagship strategic initiatives are 4-7 months behind schedule, capex prioritisation under challenge, and the FY2026 growth thesis must be refreshed in 4 weeks.". This notebook is the Zava Strategy grounded source for the M&A target due-diligence — the Group Chief of Staff and Head of Strategy convene the workstream. Synthesise across ALL 5 sources. Use Group Strategy Framework + 5-Year Plan governance as the governance reference. Every answer must cite the source file by name and the tab / section. Frame the output for the diligence findings memo + go/no-go recommendation. For every red flag produce an Action / Owner / Pre-close-condition entry with valuation impact. Tone: precise, evidence-only, never speculative.',
            instructionsID: 'Pemicu: "3 inisiatif strategis utama tertinggal jadwal 4-7 bulan, prioritisasi capex digugat, dan thesis pertumbuhan FY2026 harus diperbarui dalam 4 minggu.". Notebook ini adalah sumber tertanam Zava Strategy untuk due-diligence target M&A — Group Chief of Staff and Head of Strategy memimpin workstream. Sintesakan SEMUA 5 sumber. Gunakan Group Strategy Framework + 5-Year Plan governance sebagai referensi tata kelola. Setiap jawaban harus mengutip file sumber berdasarkan nama dan tab / bagian. Bingkai output untuk memo temuan due-diligence + rekomendasi go/no-go. Untuk setiap red flag hasilkan entry Aksi / Pemilik / Syarat-Pra-Closing dengan dampak valuasi. Nada: presisi, hanya berdasarkan bukti, tidak pernah spekulatif.',
            guide: '/00_Copilot_Notebook_Demo_Guide.docx'
