              prompt: 'Using REG_Policy_Standard_Template.docx, draft the new policy paper in English. Sections: Executive Summary, Background, Peer Regulator Landscape (insert Step 1 table), Risk Analysis (insert Step 2 synthesis), Proposed Position (3-5 detailed proposals), Implementation Plan (12-24 months), Industry Consultation Plan, Appendix A — Comparative Matrix. Tone: regulator-formal. Quote existing policy clauses verbatim where amended; mark additions in **bold** and deletions in ~~strikethrough~~. Tunggu persetujuan saya sebelum mengirim apa pun secara eksternal atau memposting ke channel.'
