      geo: 'MY',
      companyBM: 'Zava Operasi',
      taglineBM: 'Tahap perkhidmatan merosot di dua tapak, pengurangan kos ketinggalan rancangan, dan gangguan pembekal mengancam kesinambungan pengeluaran.',
      scenarioBM: 'Pejabat COO di Zava Group sedang cuba memulihkan disiplin pelaksanaan merentas beberapa tapak operasi sementara kos kekal 11% melebihi sasaran dan isu pembekal tier-1 mengancam kesinambungan di kompleks pembuatan Southport. Tahap perkhidmatan merosot kepada 87% di dua tapak utama berbanding sasaran 95%, program pengurangan kos FY2026 ketinggalan rancangan sebanyak RM 38 juta, dan pemimpin tapak tidak sependapat tentang bottleneck yang paling penting. Kepimpinan mahukan satu tracker RAG yang mengikat perkhidmatan, kos, dan kesinambungan, dan semakan bulanan seterusnya memerlukan garis pandang yang lebih tajam daripada punca utama kepada pemilik tindakan dalam 14 hari, menjelang mesyuarat Jawatankuasa Semakan Operasi di mana ahli Lembaga akan meneliti komitmen pemulihan peringkat tapak.',
      companyIDEN: 'Zava Operations',
      taglineIDEN: 'Service SLAs declined at two sites, cost takeout is below plan, and supplier disruption is threatening production continuity — ASEAN Manpower Ministry workplace safety must be maintained.',
      scenarioIDEN: 'The COO Office at Zava Group is working to restore execution discipline across several operating sites while costs remain 11% above target and a tier-1 supplier issue threatens continuity at the ASEAN Industrial Park manufacturing complex. Service SLAs dropped to 87% at two main sites against a 95% target, the FY2026 cost takeout program is below plan by IDR 580 billion, and site leaders disagree on which bottlenecks matter most. The Board wants one RAG tracker tying SLAs, cost, and continuity together, and the next monthly review needs sharper line of sight from root cause to action owner within 14 days, ahead of the Operations Review Committee meeting where the Board will probe site-level recovery commitments.',
