              prompt: 'After spreading, run a four-way parity check: 1. NYSE template Group total revenue = sum of segment revenue. 2. NYSE template Group net profit = sum of segment net profit ± inter-segment eliminations. 3. NYSE template balance sheet = previous-quarter closing + current-quarter movements. 4. NYSE template segment cap-ex = segment cap-ex from the source file.  Output `Q1_Parity_Check.xlsx` with each check, expected vs actual, variance, status. Flag anything ≠ 0. Tunggu persetujuan saya sebelum mengirim apa pun secara eksternal atau memposting ke channel.'
